      <activity id="5466dfc6-1140-5138-80bb-9fb5b025d2cd" activityNameId="71aff3ba-f210-5431-b115-5e8a7c57f0cc" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Gas motor 206kW</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Gas motor 206kW
Inventory refers to infrastructure of an existing natural gas cogeneration plant (lambda=1 motor, 160kWe, operation start 1987) at Jakobsberg, Basel, Switzerland. Module can be used generally for a gas motor. (Life time for operation assumed 70'000 h.);
UUID: 738cc7e9-0399-3e9d-8407-520eb856c547
The module includes the most important materials used for production. It includes also the transport of these materials and the energy and water needed for production.
Location: Production in Germany, assumed valid for Europe (RER).
Technology: Component of a specific cogeneration unit installed in Switzerland. Technology at end of 1980s.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Operator and manufacturer information 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_738cc7e9-0399-3e9d-8407-520eb856c547.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
